---
description: Best practices for Flask web applications
globs: **/*.py
---
- Use Flask application factories for modularity and testing
- Organize routes using Blueprints for better code organization
- Implement custom error handlers for different types of exceptions
- Use Flask's request lifecycle decorators (before_request, after_request, teardown_request)
- Utilize Flask extensions for common functionalities
- Manage configurations using Flask's config object
- Implement proper logging using Flask's app.logger
